{"sha": "6634bac58c55b31cc1a72f6c5dc087495891a02eb38e7a4f1e0ff226fef211c9", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "波长为 $\\lambda$ 的光子携带 $hc/\\lambda$ 的能量；一摩尔光子携带 $N_Ahc/\\lambda$。白", "光去掉被吸收的波段后，所见颜色为其互补色。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[由吸收带求颜色]\\label{met:b2:ligand-field:colour}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将 $\\lambda_{\\max}$ 换算为波数 $\\tilde\\nu = 1/\\lambda_{\\max}$（\\unit{cm^{-1}}），并换算为", "        $N_Ahc/\\lambda_{\\max}$（\\unit{kJ/mol}）：$\\qty{500}{nm} \\leftrightarrow \\qty{20000}{cm^{-1}}", "        \\leftrightarrow \\qty{239}{kJ/mol}$。", "  \\item 找出被吸收的颜色（紫色 400--430，蓝色 430--490，绿色 490--560，黄色", "        560--590，橙色 590--620，红色 620--700 nm，大致）。", "  \\item 所见颜色在色轮上与之相对。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\scriptsize]", "  \\foreach \\a/\\c/\\n in {90/red/red, 150/orange/orange, 210/yellow/yellow, 270/green!70!black/green, 330/blue/blue, 30/violet/violet} {", "    \\fill[\\c!75] (0,0) -- (\\a-30:1.3) arc[start angle=\\a-30, end angle=\\a+30, radius=1.3] -- cycle;", "    \\node[anchor=\\a+180] at (\\a:1.38) {\\n};", "  }", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.3);", "  \\draw[<->, thick] (90:0.9) -- (270:0.9);", "  \\node[anchor=west, font=\\small, align=left] at (2.6,0) {吸收绿光（约 500--560 nm）时，配合物呈红紫色；\\\\ 吸收橙光则呈蓝色。};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 色轮示意：所见颜色大致是所吸收颜色的互补色，", "即在色轮上直径两端相对的颜色。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[光谱化学序列]\\label{def:b2:ligand-field:spectrochemical}", "\\emph{光谱化学序列}\\index{光谱化学序列}将配体按", "其对给定金属离子产生的分裂大小排序：", "\\[", "  \\ce{I-} < \\ce{Br-} < \\ce{Cl-} < \\ce{F-} < \\ce{OH-} < \\ce{H2O} < \\ce{NH3} < \\text{en} <", "  \\ce{NO2-} < \\ce{CN-} < \\ce{CO} .", "\\]", "对给定配体，$\\Delta_o$ 也随金属离子电荷增大而增大，并随", "同族元素向下而增大（4d 与 5d 配合物比 3d 配合物大，几乎总是低自旋）。", "\\end{definition}", "", "卤化物位于弱端，\\ce{CN-} 与 \\ce{CO} 位于强端，晶体场模型", "无法解释这一点：它会把带电的 \\ce{F-} 排在中性的", "\\ce{CO} 之上。解释需借助轨道。", "", "\\section{配体场}", "", "\\begin{definition}[配体场理论]\\label{def:b2:ligand-field:ligand-field}", "\\emph{配体场理论}\\index{配体场理论}用分子轨道描述配合物，其分子轨道", "由金属的价轨道（共九个：$n$d、$(n+1)$s 与 $(n+1)$p", "轨道）和配体的给体轨道构成。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[八面体配合物中的 $\\sigma$ 成键]\\label{prop:b2:ligand-field:mo-octahedral}", "六个配体各提供一个 $\\sigma$ 给体轨道，共形成六个成键分子轨道，", "由金属的 s 轨道、三个 p 轨道和两个 $e_g$ d 轨道组成；三个 $t_{2g}$ 轨道", "指向配体之间，保持非键；其上方是反键的 $e_g^*$", "轨道。配体电子填满六个成键轨道，金属的 d 电子进入", "$t_{2g}$ 与 $e_g^*$，二者相差 $\\Delta_o$。成键与非键轨道共可容纳", "$12 + 6 = 18$ 个电子。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}[论证]", "依\\cref{ch:b2:fragment-orbitals}中的片段方法，每个金属轨道与", "同一对称性的配体轨道组合相互作用：s 轨道与全对称组合，", "每个 p 轨道与一对相对的配体组合，$\\mathrm d_{z^2}$ 与 $\\mathrm", "d_{x^2-y^2}$ 与沿其瓣方向的组合相互作用；没有任何 $\\sigma$ 组合", "与 $t_{2g}$ 轨道匹配（它们与任何沿坐标轴方向的 $\\sigma$ 给体的重叠", "由对称性为零）。这些组合的名称来自群论，在本阶段不加证明地承认。", "填满所有成键与非键轨道、而不填入任何反键轨道，需", "18 个电子 --- 即 18 电子规则。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\scriptsize]", "  % metal", "  \\pic (m4p1) at (-0.45,2.6) {omlevel={empty}{0.4}}; \\pic (m4p2) at (0,2.6) {omlevel={empty}{0.4}}; \\pic (m4p3) at (0.45,2.6) {omlevel={empty}{0.4}};", "  \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.7,2.6) {$(n{+}1)$p};", "  \\pic (m4s) at (0,1.8) {omlevel={empty}{0.6}}; \\node[anchor=east] at (-0.35,1.8) {$(n{+}1)$s};", "  \\foreach \\x in {-0.9,-0.45,0,0.45,0.9} \\pic at (\\x,0.6) {omlevel={empty}{0.4}};", "  \\coordinate (m3d) at (1.1,0.6); \\node[anchor=east] at (-1.15,0.6) {$n$d};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (0,-2.9) {金属};", "  % ligands", "  \\foreach \\x in {6.2,6.72,7.24,7.76,8.28,8.8} \\pic at (\\x,-0.9) {omlevel={ud}{0.36}};", "  \\coordinate (lig) at (6.0,-0.9);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (7.3,-2.9) {六个 $\\sigma$ 给体轨道};", "  % MOs", "  \\pic (b1) at (3.6,-2.4) {omlevel={ud}{0.5}};", "  \\foreach \\x in {3.0,3.6,4.2} \\pic at (\\x,-1.9) {omlevel={ud}{0.5}};", "  \\pic at (3.3,-1.45) {omlevel={ud}{0.5}}; \\pic at (3.9,-1.45) {omlevel={ud}{0.5}};", "  \\foreach \\x in {3.0,3.6,4.2} \\pic at (\\x,0.3) {omlevel={empty}{0.5}};", "  \\pic at (3.3,1.5) {omlevel={empty}{0.5}}; \\pic at (3.9,1.5) {omlevel={empty}{0.5}};", "  \\pic at (3.6,3.1) {omlevel={empty}{0.5}};", "  \\foreach \\x in {3.0,3.6,4.2} \\pic at (\\x,3.6) {omlevel={empty}{0.5}};", "  \\node[anchor=north] at (3.6,0.12) {$t_{2g}$（非键）};", "  \\node[anchor=west] at (4.2,1.5) {$e_g^*$};", "  \\node[anchor=north] at (3.6,-2.58) {6 个成键轨道};", "  \\draw[<->, omProp] (2.55,0.3) -- (2.55,1.5) node[midway, right] {$\\Delta_o$};", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (m3d) -- (2.75,0.3) (m3d) -- (3.05,1.5) (1.1,0.6) -- (3.05,-1.45);", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (lig) -- (4.15,-1.45) (lig) -- (4.45,-1.9) (lig) -- (3.85,-2.4) (lig) -- (4.15,1.5);", "  \\draw[omcorr, densely dashed] (m4s-r) -- (3.35,-2.4) (m4s-r) -- (3.35,3.1) (m4p3-r) -- (2.75,-1.9) (m4p3-r) -- (2.75,3.6);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 八面体配合物的分子轨道（示意），含六个 $\\sigma$", "给体。配体的十二个电子填满六个成键轨道；金属的 d", "电子占据非键的 $t_{2g}$ 与反键的 $e_g^*$ 能级，二者相差", "$\\Delta_o$ --- 即晶体场图像的再现。至多 18 个电子填满成键与", "非键能级。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}